    test: "Common-protocol federated analysis (Sweden, Denmark, Finland, Scotland, Ontario, Israel) of bariatric surgery and GLP-1 receptor agonist exposure vs matched obese controls with cancer incidence by site as outcome; pre-registered, with results published within three years.",
